---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "All Digital Nomad Comparisons: Cost of Living, Visas & Taxes"
description: "Compare cities and countries for digital nomads side-by-side. Our data engine breaks down cost of living, taxes, and visa requirements."
permalink: /compare/
---
<main class="py-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Compare Nomad Hubs</h1>
  <p class="text-xl text-dim mb-12 max-w-3xl">Explore our comprehensive database of city and country comparisons. Find the perfect digital nomad destination by comparing cost of living, visas, and tax benefits side-by-side.</p>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-white/10 text-accent">Top City vs City Comparisons</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    {% for comp in comparisons %}
      <a href="/compare/{{ comp.slug }}/" class="block p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-white/10 transition">
        <span class="font-medium">{{ comp.cityA.name }} vs {{ comp.cityB.name }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-white/10 text-accent">City vs Country Comparisons</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    {% for comp in cityCountryComparisons %}
      <a href="/compare/city-vs-country/{{ comp.slug }}/" class="block p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-white/10 transition">
        <span class="font-medium">{{ comp.city.name }} vs {{ comp.country.name }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 pb-2 border-b border-white/10 text-accent">Country vs Country Visas & Taxes</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
    {% for comp in countryComparisons %}
      <a href="/compare/country/{{ comp.slug }}/" class="block p-4 bg-white/5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-white/10 transition">
        <span class="font-medium">{{ comp.countryA.name }} vs {{ comp.countryB.name }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
